{% comment %}
  Rebrand person hero — the head of a teacher page and of an artist page.
  Same anatomy in both comps: the name in large IvyPresto on the left, a
  subtitle under it, a social row, and on the right a large artwork running
  off the right edge with a black-and-white portrait set into it.

  The two differ only in the subtitle and the palette:
    Teacher — coral name, a row of medium tags, an Instagram round icon and a
              "See Portfolio" pill.
    Artist  — moss name, a line of Cedarville script, Instagram only.

  On a collection template the name and artwork default to the collection, so
  an artist or teacher collection is correct as soon as it gets the template.
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'saf-rebrand.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign sid = section.id
  assign name = section.settings.name | default: collection.title

  comment
    The comp shows a row of mediums under a teacher's name. The catalogue
    already carries them as medium-* product tags, so an empty field reads
    them off the collection rather than leaving the row blank or, worse,
    repeating one person's mediums on everyone else's page.
  endcomment
  assign tag_source = section.settings.tags
  if tag_source == blank
    assign mediums = ''
    for t in collection.all_tags
      assign lower = t | downcase
      if lower contains 'medium-'
        assign label = lower | remove_first: 'medium-' | replace: '-', ' ' | capitalize
        unless mediums contains label
          assign mediums = mediums | append: ',' | append: label
        endunless
      endif
    endfor
    assign tag_source = mediums | remove_first: ','
  endif
  assign tags = tag_source | split: ','

  comment
    The design pairs one of the person's works, running off the right edge,
    with their black-and-white portrait set into it. Both come from the
    collection so that forty person pages are right from one shape:

      portrait — the collection's own image, which in this store is the photo
                 of the person;
      artwork  — the first piece in the collection that is not that same photo.

    A collection with nothing but the portrait falls back to showing it large
    with no inset, because the same picture twice reads as a mistake.
  endcomment
  assign art = section.settings.image
  assign portrait = section.settings.portrait
  if portrait == blank
    assign portrait = collection.image
  endif
  if art == blank
    for item in collection.products limit: 8
      if item.featured_image != blank and item.featured_image != portrait
        assign art = item.featured_image
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  if art == blank
    assign art = portrait
    assign portrait = blank
  endif

  comment
    "See Portfolio" on a teacher page belongs on that person's ARTIST
    collection. Someone who both teaches and exhibits has two collections
    sharing one title — "Susan Orpen" as susan-orpen-1 (teacher) and
    susan-orpen (artist).

    Handleizing the title to find the twin looked obvious and was wrong:
    "Zara-Leigh Farinha" handleizes to zara-leigh-farinha, which is a stale
    collection, while her real artist page is zara-leigh. So the twin is found
    through the work instead — the two collections share products, so the
    first collection on one of this person's pieces that carries the same
    title under a different handle is the one wanted.

    A teacher who does not exhibit resolves to nothing and the button is
    dropped rather than left pointing at "#".
  endcomment
  assign portfolio_url = section.settings.button_link
  if portfolio_url == blank and collection != blank
    for item in collection.products limit: 4
      for sibling in item.collections
        if sibling.handle != collection.handle and sibling.title == collection.title
          assign portfolio_url = sibling.url
          break
        endif
      endfor
      if portfolio_url != blank
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  assign show_portfolio = false
  if section.settings.button_label != blank and portfolio_url != blank
    assign show_portfolio = true
  endif

  comment
    The store already keeps per-person socials in the booking_app.socials shop
    metafield, keyed by the handleized display name — the same key
    snippets/social-links.liquid uses. Reading it here means an artist or
    teacher page shows the right Instagram without anyone filling in 40
    templates by hand.
  endcomment
  assign social_url = section.settings.social_url
  if social_url == blank and name != blank
    assign social_key = name | handleize
    assign person_socials = shop.metafields.booking_app.socials.value[social_key]
    if person_socials != blank
      assign social_url = person_socials.instagram
    endif
  endif
-%}

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph {
    background: {{ section.settings.background }};
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: {{ section.settings.text_width }}fr {{ 100 | minus: section.settings.text_width }}fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(24px, 3.13vw, 60px);
    padding-block: clamp(40px, 5.21vw, 100px);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__text {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding-left: var(--rb-gutter);
    text-align: {{ section.settings.align }};
    {% if section.settings.align == 'center' %}
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    {% endif %}
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__name {
    color: {{ section.settings.name_color }};
    max-width: 8ch; /* both comps break the name after the first word */
    {% if section.settings.align == 'center' %}text-align: center;{% endif %}
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__script {
    margin-top: clamp(10px, 1.04vw, 20px);
    color: {{ section.settings.script_color }};
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.35vw, 26px);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__script p { margin: 0; }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: clamp(8px, 0.83vw, 16px);
    margin: clamp(10px, 1.04vw, 20px) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    {% if section.settings.align == 'center' %}justify-content: center;{% endif %}
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__tag {
    font-family: var(--rb-sans);
    font-size: var(--rb-fs-body-sm);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ section.settings.tag_color }};
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(8px, 0.83vw, 16px);
    margin-top: clamp(14px, 1.46vw, 28px);
    {% if section.settings.align == 'center' %}justify-content: center;{% endif %}
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__social {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: clamp(30px, 2.08vw, 40px);
    height: clamp(30px, 2.08vw, 40px);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__social img { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__media {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(240px, 23.6vw, 453px);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #efefef;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__media > img,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__media > svg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: {{ section.settings.focal_x }}% {{ section.settings.focal_y }}%;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__portrait {
    left: {{ section.settings.portrait_x }}%;
    top: {{ section.settings.portrait_y }}%;
    width: {{ section.settings.portrait_w }}%;
    aspect-ratio: {{ section.settings.portrait_ratio }};
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding-block: 40px 0;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__text { padding-inline: var(--rb-gutter); }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__name { max-width: none; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .rb-ph__media { height: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
  }
</style>

<div class="rb-section rb-bleed">
  <div class="rb-ph">
    <div class="rb-ph__text">
      {%- if name != blank -%}
        <h1 class="rb-name rb-name--lg rb-ph__name">{{ name }}</h1>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.script != blank -%}
        <div class="rb-script rb-ph__script">{{ section.settings.script }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if tags.size > 0 and section.settings.tags != blank -%}
        <ul class="rb-ph__tags" role="list">
          {%- for tag in tags -%}
            <li class="rb-ph__tag">{{ tag | strip }}</li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if social_url != blank or show_portfolio -%}
        <div class="rb-ph__actions">
          {%- if social_url != blank -%}
            <a href="{{ social_url }}" class="rb-ph__social"
               target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ name | escape }} on Instagram">
              <img src="{{ 'saf-icon-instagram.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="60" height="60" loading="lazy">
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if show_portfolio -%}
            <a href="{{ portfolio_url }}" class="rb-btn rb-btn--plain rb-btn--outline">
              {{- section.settings.button_label | escape -}}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="rb-ph__media">
      {%- if art != blank -%}
        {{
          art
          | image_url: width: 1920
          | image_tag:
            widths: '480, 700, 960, 1400, 1920',
            sizes: '(max-width: 749px) 100vw, 55vw',
            loading: 'eager',
            alt: art.alt | default: name
        }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if portrait != blank -%}
        <div class="rb-inset rb-ph__portrait">
          {{
            portrait
            | image_url: width: 700
            | image_tag:
              widths: '240, 360, 520, 700',
              sizes: '(max-width: 749px) 40vw, 20vw',
              loading: 'eager',
              alt: portrait.alt | default: name
          }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Rebrand person hero",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "rb-section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Heads a teacher page or an artist page. On a collection template the name and artwork fill themselves from the collection." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "name", "label": "Name",
      "info": "Blank uses the collection title." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "script", "label": "Script line",
      "info": "Cedarville Cursive, as on the artist page." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tags", "label": "Tags",
      "info": "Comma separated, e.g. Abstract, Watercolour, Photography. Blank reads the mediums off this collection's own artwork tags." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Actions" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "social_url", "label": "Instagram link",
      "info": "Blank uses the Instagram already saved for this person in the admin app." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "button_label", "label": "Button label",
      "info": "The teacher page uses 'See Portfolio'." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "button_link", "label": "Button link",
      "info": "Blank looks for a collection with the same title — a teacher's own artist page. The button is hidden when there is none." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Layout" },
    { "type": "select", "id": "align", "label": "Text alignment", "default": "left",
      "options": [
        { "value": "left", "label": "Left" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "Centred (artist page)" }
      ] },
    { "type": "range", "id": "text_width", "min": 25, "max": 60, "step": 1,
      "default": 40, "unit": "%", "label": "Text share of the row" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colour" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "background", "default": "#ffffff", "label": "Background" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "name_color", "default": "#e07468", "label": "Name" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "script_color", "default": "#1e1e1e", "label": "Script line" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "tag_color", "default": "#0c3642", "label": "Tags" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Artwork" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Artwork",
      "info": "Blank uses the first piece in the collection." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "focal_x", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 1,
      "default": 50, "unit": "%", "label": "Artwork focal point — horizontal" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "focal_y", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 1,
      "default": 50, "unit": "%", "label": "Artwork focal point — vertical" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Portrait inset" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "portrait", "label": "Portrait",
      "info": "Blank uses the collection's own image, which is the photo of the person. Rendered black and white, as in the design." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "portrait_w", "min": 15, "max": 70, "step": 1,
      "default": 40, "unit": "%", "label": "Portrait width" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "portrait_ratio", "default": "1 / 1", "label": "Portrait aspect ratio" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "portrait_x", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 1,
      "default": 50, "unit": "%", "label": "Portrait centre — horizontal" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "portrait_y", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 1,
      "default": 48, "unit": "%", "label": "Portrait centre — vertical" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Rebrand person hero" }]
}
{% endschema %}
